config RTC_DRV_PCF85063_WITTYPI4
	tristate "Witty Pi 4 PCF85063 I2C register-window proxy"
	help
	  I2C proxy for the PCF85063 RTC on Witty Pi 4. The on-board MCU
	  exposes the RTC registers at a fixed offset and only accepts
	  single-byte transfers. This driver presents a nested I2C adapter
	  so the in-tree rtc-pcf85063 driver can bind as usual.

	  Requires CONFIG_RTC_DRV_PCF85063 (module rtc-pcf85063).

	  This driver can also be built as a module. If so, the module
	  will be called rtc-pcf85063-wittypi4.
